{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the beginning of <i>The Last Good Boy</i>, offering approximately 5\u20138 hours of gameplay. It showcases the core mechanics\u2014including resource gathering, combat, and crafting\u2014through 13 fully optional quests. These quests serve as both a tutorial and an introduction to the game\u2019s world and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Curious to know what lies beyond? Read on to discover the full journey that awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900680/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.poster.avif?t=1753811141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900680/extras/86f597b6f37afd0d7c4ddd13905fb236.webm?t=1753811141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have you ever wondered how similar our dog's life is to that of an RPG game? Well, I did.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by my real-life dog, <strong>Ramon</strong>. He\u2019s a small Shih Tzu with a big imagination! He loves playing with his toys\u2014uh, I mean, weapons. Sometimes, he enjoys fetching ranged weapons (like a good ol\u2019 ball); other times, he prefers melee combat with sticks and bones. Oh, and he even has some stylish outfits\u2014oops, I mean armor\u2014to keep him safe from the harsh environment!<strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900680/extras/19c3b4258a985f8ce3c20b2d0eb91a89.avif?t=1753811141\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900680/extras/6dc524e7ac76e4945bc42